  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Earn While Helping Men Level Up Their Energy, Performance &amp; Vitality</strong></p><h3>About our brand and products:</h3><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">ManCharge is a premium men’s performance supplement line designed specifically for driven men who want more energy, better performance, higher testosterone support, and deeper sleep. Our products use clinically-dosed, research-backed ingredients to deliver real, noticeable results that customers can feel.</p><h3>What makes us different:</h3><ul><li>Transparent, clinically effective dosing with full label disclosure</li><li>Targeted formulas focused purely on male physiology (energy, performance, testosterone, sleep)</li><li>Premium USA manufacturing with third-party testing</li><li>High customer retention — men reorder because they feel the difference</li><li>Strong brand focused only on men’s peak performance</li></ul><h3>How affiliates can earn:</h3><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">We offer a clear, performance-based tier system that rewards growth — <strong>the ManCharge Athlete Commission Tiers</strong>:</p><div><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\" border=\"1\"><thead><tr><th>Tier</th><th>Monthly Sales Generated</th><th>Commission Rate</th><th>Customer Discount You Can Offer</th><th>Free Products Per Month</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Starter</td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">$0 – $500</td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">10%</td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">15% off</td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">1 product</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Bronze</td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">$501 – $1,500</td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">12%</td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">15% off</td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">2 products</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Silver</td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">$1,501 – $3,000</td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">15%</td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">20% off</td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">3 products</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Gold</td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">$3,001 – $7,500</td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">18%</td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">20% off</td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Full product line</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Elite</td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">$7,500+</td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>20%</strong></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>25% off</strong></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Full line + extras</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"height:1px;width:766px;\"><br></div><p><br></p><ul><li>Tiers evaluated on the 1st of each month based on the prior 30-day rolling sales</li><li>Move up (or down) tiers automatically — the more you sell, the higher your rate and perks</li><li><strong>Extra monthly cash bonuses</strong> for Bronze tier and above (see Affiliate Program Guide)</li><li>Commissions paid on <strong>all qualifying sales</strong> through your unique link — including rebills and repeat orders</li><li>Net-15 payouts (by the 15th of the following month) via PayPal, Venmo, or direct deposit</li><li>$25 minimum payout threshold (amounts roll over)</li><li>Lifetime customer tracking — earn every time your referrals buy again</li></ul><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Top affiliates quickly climb into Gold and Elite, stacking commissions + bonuses + free product value into serious monthly income.</p><h3>How to promote us:</h3><ul><li>Use your unique affiliate link (and the customer discount code tied to your tier)</li><li>We supply everything: professional banners, product images, email sequences, social captions, ad creatives, and landing pages</li><li>Perfect for Instagram, TikTok, YouTube, podcasts, blogs, email lists, and men’s fitness/biohacking communities</li><li>Minimum: just 2 pieces of ManCharge content per week (easy when you love the products)</li></ul><h3>Other information:</h3><ul><li><strong>Welcome Kit</strong>: Every approved affiliate gets a free product kit shipped immediately for your own use and content</li><li>Ongoing monthly free product shipments based on your current tier</li><li>30-day money-back guarantee on every customer order (zero risk for your audience)</li><li>Dedicated affiliate manager + full resource vault</li><li>60-day cookie duration</li><li>Full FTC-compliant disclosures required (#ad, #partner, etc.)</li><li>2-month initial term, then auto-renews every 3 months</li><li>Non-exclusive — but no competing supplement brands during the term</li></ul><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Ready to join one of the fastest-growing men’s performance brands and start earning real money while promoting products that actually work?</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Apply to the ManCharge Affiliate Program Now</strong>Spots are limited — we only accept partners whose audience truly matches high-achieving men 25–55.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Let’s charge the game together 💪</p><section><br></section><section><br></section></div></div>",
